---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "../components/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<Layout title="About SBGP" description="Discover Subic Bay Gateway Park — a world-class industrial park with modern infrastructure in the Subic Bay Freeport Zone.">
  <section class="bg-primary-500 py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="mb-4 inline-block border border-white/20 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white/70">About the Park</div>
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-6xl">Subic Bay Gateway Park</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/70">Description, Infrastructure & Master Plan</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Breadcrumb pages={[{ label: "About Us", href: "/about-sbdmc" }, { label: "About SBGP" }]} />

  <section class="bg-surface py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Park Description</h2>
      <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-600" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        Subic Bay Gateway Park (SBGP) is a <strong class="text-gray-900">45-hectare industrial park</strong> situated within the Subic Bay Freeport Zone. It offers a strategic location with easy access to the Subic Bay International Airport, the Subic Bay Seaport, and the major highway networks of Luzon.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-600" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        SBGP is designed to accommodate a wide range of industries, including light manufacturing, logistics, warehousing, and business process outsourcing (BPO). The park provides a secure, well-maintained environment with modern facilities and infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-12 text-center text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Infrastructure</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Power</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Reliable electricity with backup generators and redundant supply lines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Water</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Adequate water supply with treatment facilities and fire hydrant system.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071c3.904-3.905 10.236-3.905 14.141 0M1.394 9.393c5.857-5.858 15.355-5.858 21.213 0" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Telecom</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">High-speed fiber optic internet and telecommunications infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 20l-5.447-2.724A1 1 0 013 16.382V5.618a1 1 0 011.447-.894L9 7m0 13l6-3m-6 3V7m6 10l4.553 2.276A1 1 0 0021 18.382V7.618a1 1 0 00-.553-.894L15 4m0 13V4m0 0L9 7" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Roads</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Well-maintained internal road network with proper lighting and signage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Security</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">24/7 security monitoring, controlled access, and CCTV surveillance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-l-4 border-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white"><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16" /></svg></div>
          <h3 class="mb-1 font-bold text-primary-500">Waste Mgmt</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Proper waste collection, disposal services, and drainage systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Master Plan</h2>
      <p class="mb-8 leading-relaxed text-gray-600" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        The master plan of SBGP includes zoned areas for different types of industrial activities, green spaces, commercial areas, and support facilities. The park is designed for future expansion to accommodate growing demand.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">Industrial</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Manufacturing & Logistics</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">Commercial</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Offices & Retail</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-500">Green Space</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">Parks & Buffer Zones</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-500" data-aos="fade-up">Accessibility</h2>
      <p class="mb-10 leading-relaxed text-gray-600" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        SBGP is designed to be accessible to all, with compliant facilities and pathways for persons with disabilities. The park follows universal design principles to ensure inclusivity.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-primary-500 p-8 text-white text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Video Presentations</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 text-white/80">Contact us for video presentations showcasing the park's facilities and locator opportunities.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-white">Request a Presentation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
